{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:15 2026-09-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:15 2026-09-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:15 2026-09-06 HKT</p><p>今日（6日）早上10時08分，深水埗福華街146至152號高登電腦中心發生火警，保安員發現一樓樓層有濃煙冒出，於是報案。消防員到場開喉灌救，其後將火救熄，經調查相信是一店舖內有電線短路，惹起火災。</p><p>事發時涉事一樓尚未有店舖開門營業，一間店舖閉門失火。事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。</p><img alt=\"高登電腦中心發生火警。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dfde5869eed89eed395eb040a0fa8db2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"高登電腦中心發生火警。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/de49a5fdf58c7913e184d53ee3e9db94/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_08.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員在一樓調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a2ddaf384f2260c7822dceca0b8d8096/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_09_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是福華街146至152號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d4473880b428247d4c9b3f1e3227f81b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_10_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d3b13ce6d72296ee4496593f41e4b128/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_10.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b8cdd4440c5e3b75ff52e1106f89ed26/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_08_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/13f8cf1e2855aaa53268e7443c30ff59/2026-09/1_1_7.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ecb9f6e21ecb4fad3131e2a6852aff2d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_11_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d9a1371226825079749ecb77f0b59536/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/39b2b51b112165a41d7215b23a9cae67/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-06_at_10_56_10_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T04:18:56.833712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}